00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:44.040
It's a very real subject with tangible society-altering implications.

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:52.340
'Fight Club,' the film, is a confused, messy celebration and self-condemnation of the worst of what masculinity has to offer.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.080
It revels in the violence that rips itself apart.

00:05:57.240 --> 00:05:59.240
