00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.820
drunk on the power trip of violence and hedonism,

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:04.820
all the while being unable to escape the damage being done.

00:06:07.280 --> 00:06:09.280
The narrator, who we'll refer to as Jack, is our modern put-upon everyman.

00:06:13.960 --> 00:06:15.960
He has followed the societal script: grown up, gone to college, gotten a degree, got a job, has an apartment filled with furniture and...

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:16.900
now what?

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:20.180
"I can't get married."

00:06:20.820 --> 00:06:22.820
"I'm a 30-year-old boy."

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:27.340
